    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/78aefe76f438d90d309a4ed3e6b11e38.avif?t=1755371396\" width=600 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place Towers, Defeat Enemies, Stack Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your towers to fend off massive waves of thousands of enemies at once. Every defeated enemy grants resources you can use to endlessly upgrade your towers\u2014more damage, faster shots, greater range. The pressure increases with every wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy &amp; Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towers need power to fire\u2014generate it using massive solar fields and deliver it to your towers via drones. Enemies drop resources that must be processed in various factories to level up your towers. Only a well-balanced supply chain will keep your defense strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.poster.avif?t=1755371396\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.webm?t=1755371396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.mp4?t=1755371396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Towers for Every Situation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from melee, ranged, single-target, or area damage towers\u2014each type excels against specific enemy classes. Combine them wisely, unlock special towers, and find your perfect defense strategy. Only those who adapt will survive the strongest waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/bb7f339ebd4a232dacd2ebb6e9c3405d.poster.avif?t=1755371396\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/bb7f339ebd4a232dacd2ebb6e9c3405d.webp?t=1755371396\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Game Over \u2013 Only Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your typical tower defense! If you lose a wave, you\u2019ll simply jump back to the last checkpoint\u2014ready to try again. You never lose everything; instead, you push forward step by step. Every setback is just another step toward victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/78aefe76f438d90d309a4ed3e6b11e38.avif?t=1755371396\" width=600 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Place Towers, Defeat Enemies, Stack Upgrades</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your towers to fend off massive waves of thousands of enemies at once. Every defeated enemy grants resources you can use to endlessly upgrade your towers\u2014more damage, faster shots, greater range. The pressure increases with every wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy &amp; Production</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towers need power to fire\u2014generate it using massive solar fields and deliver it to your towers via drones. Enemies drop resources that must be processed in various factories to level up your towers. Only a well-balanced supply chain will keep your defense strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.poster.avif?t=1755371396\" width=600 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.webm?t=1755371396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/a82cb196c641bd4ad87331dac23a5367.mp4?t=1755371396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Towers for Every Situation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from melee, ranged, single-target, or area damage towers\u2014each type excels against specific enemy classes. Combine them wisely, unlock special towers, and find your perfect defense strategy. Only those who adapt will survive the strongest waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/bb7f339ebd4a232dacd2ebb6e9c3405d.poster.avif?t=1755371396\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653600/extras/bb7f339ebd4a232dacd2ebb6e9c3405d.webp?t=1755371396\" class=\"bb_img\" width=200 height=200 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Game Over \u2013 Only Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your typical tower defense! If you lose a wave, you\u2019ll simply jump back to the last checkpoint\u2014ready to try again. You never lose everything; instead, you push forward step by step. Every setback is just another step toward victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
